# This repository contains a frozen, byte-compared baseline:
#   - design-tokens-generic-v4/     the pre-migration prototype (never edited)
#   - packages/tokens/src|assets/   a byte-identical copy of it
# Tools assert those bytes with SHA256, so line-ending conversion is disabled
# everywhere: a fresh checkout must reproduce exactly what is on disk.
# (The original prototype CSS uses CRLF, which is why this matters.)
* -text

*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
